From: AllyncID <177745969+AllyncID@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Skip remote profile lookups in offline mode

Offline local/proxy servers do not authenticate with Mojang. Avoid fetching
profile textures during login in that mode so large local join tests and
offline survival servers do not depend on Mojang rate limits.
Original Quantum additions: MIT (LICENSE-QUANTUM).

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
--- a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
@@ -355,1 +355,1 @@ public class ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl implements ServerLoginPacketListener, TickablePacketListener {
-        profile.complete(true); // Paper - setPlayerProfileAPI
+        profile.complete(true, ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.this.server.usesAuthentication()); // Quantum - offline local servers do not need remote texture lookups
